0d9a\u0ddc\u0da7\u0dc4\u0dda\u0db1 \u0dc1\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dca\u0dad \u0dbd\u0dd4\u0dc3\u0dd2\u0dba\u0dcf \u0d86\u0dc3\u0db1 \u0daf\u0dd9\u0dc0\u0dca\u0db8\u0dd0\u0daf\u0dd4\u0dbb Kothahena Santha Lusiya Asana Dewum\u00e6dura) is the seat of the Archbishop of the Roman Catholic Archdiocese of Colombo in Sri Lanka. The cathedral is located at Kotahena, in the north east of Colombo, on 18,240 sq. ft. of land. It traces its origins to a small structure for worship built during the Dutch occupation.", "extract_html": "<p><b>St. Lucia's Cathedral</b>, Sinhala: \u0d9a\u0ddc\u0da7\u0dc4\u0dda\u0db1 \u0dc1\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dca\u0dad \u0dbd\u0dd4\u0dc3\u0dd2\u0dba\u0dcf \u0d86\u0dc3\u0db1 \u0daf\u0dd9\u0dc0\u0dca\u0db8\u0dd0\u0daf\u0dd4\u0dbb <i>Kothahena Santha Lusiya Asana Dewum\u00e6dura</i>) is the seat of the Archbishop of the Roman Catholic Archdiocese of Colombo in Sri Lanka. The cathedral is located at Kotahena, in the north east of Colombo, on 18,240 sq. ft. of land. It traces its origins to a small structure for worship built during the Dutch occupation.</p>"}